#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:4
msgid "AI Tasks"
msgstr "Tareas de IA"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:6
msgid ""
"AI Tasks are a Task type in |morpheus| that uses plain-language "
"configuration to perform actions via a configured AI Agent. AI Tasks can:"
msgstr "Las AI Tasks son un tipo de tarea en |morpheus| que usa configuración en lenguaje natural para realizar acciones mediante un AI Agent configurado. Las AI Tasks pueden:"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:8
msgid "Perform singular one-off functions (ad-hoc Task execution)"
msgstr "Realizar funciones puntuales únicas (ejecución ad hoc de tareas)"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:9
msgid "Perform repeating functions (configured as recurring Task Jobs)"
msgstr "Realizar funciones repetitivas (configuradas como Task Jobs recurrentes)"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:10
msgid "Be part of large-scale Workflows (Operational or Provisioning Workflows)"
msgstr "Formar parte de flujos de trabajo a gran escala (Operational o Provisioning Workflows)"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:12
msgid ""
"The AI Task type appears in the Task Types list as \"AI Task\" with the "
"following source options: Local, Repository, URL. The execute target is "
"Local. The role permission required is **Library: Tasks**."
msgstr "El tipo AI Task aparece en la lista de tipos de tarea como \"AI Task\" con las siguientes opciones de origen: Local, Repository, URL. El destino de ejecución es Local. El permiso de rol requerido es **Library: Tasks**."

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:15
msgid "Creating an AI Task"
msgstr "Creación de una AI Task"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:17
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Library --> Automation --> Tasks` and click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD`. Select \"AI Task\" from the Task Types list."
msgstr "Navegue a :menuselection:`Library --> Automation --> Tasks` y haga clic en :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Seleccione \"AI Task\" en la lista de tipos de tarea."

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:23
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Campo"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:24
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:25
msgid "**Name**"
msgstr "**Name**"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:26
msgid "Name of the Task"
msgstr "Nombre de la tarea"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:27
msgid "**Code**"
msgstr "**Code**"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:28
msgid "Unique code name for API, CLI, and variable references"
msgstr "Nombre de código único para referencias de API, CLI y variables"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:29
msgid "**Agent**"
msgstr "**Agent**"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:30
msgid "Select a pre-existing AI Agent (see :ref:`ai-agents` documentation)"
msgstr "Seleccione un AI Agent existente (consulte la documentación :ref:`ai-agents`)"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:31
msgid "**Inventory**"
msgstr "**Inventory**"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:32
msgid ""
"Select an existing Inventory; when bootstrapping an Instance, |morpheus| "
"will add the Instance to the Inventory"
msgstr "Seleccione un inventario existente; al inicializar una instancia, |morpheus| agregará la instancia al inventario"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:33
msgid "**Content**"
msgstr "**Content**"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:34
msgid "Plain-language prompting for the AI Agent to use in executing the Task"
msgstr "Indicaciones en lenguaje natural para que el AI Agent las use al ejecutar la tarea"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:37
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Uso"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:39
msgid "AI Tasks can be executed in the following ways:"
msgstr "Las AI Tasks pueden ejecutarse de las siguientes formas:"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Ad-hoc execution** — Run the Task manually from the Tasks list or via "
"API/CLI for one-off operations"
msgstr "**Ejecución ad hoc** — Ejecute la tarea manualmente desde la lista de tareas o mediante API/CLI para operaciones puntuales"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Recurring Jobs** — Configure the Task as a Job with a schedule for "
"repeating functions"
msgstr "**Jobs recurrentes** — Configure la tarea como un job con un programa para funciones repetitivas"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Workflows** — Include the Task as a step in Operational or Provisioning"
" Workflows for large-scale automation"
msgstr "**Flujos de trabajo** — Incluya la tarea como paso en Operational o Provisioning Workflows para automatización a gran escala"

#: ../../tools/ai/ai_tasks.rst:45
msgid ""
"The **Content** field is where the plain-language instruction is defined."
" This prompt is sent to the selected AI Agent, which uses its configured "
"LLM and available tools to carry out the requested action."
msgstr "El campo **Content** es donde se define la instrucción en lenguaje natural. Este prompt se envía al AI Agent seleccionado, que usa su LLM configurado y las herramientas disponibles para llevar a cabo la acción solicitada."

